<p>(1) In the third quarter of 1995 the Company recognized a net gain of approximately $16 million before income taxes on the sale of five of its bottom supported rigs and an adjustment relating to a rig sold in December, 1995.  In the second quarter of 1996 the Company recognized a gain of approximately $6.6 million before taxes from the disposal of a bottom- supported rig.</p>
